{"reviewId": "306739280_89PrItFGI", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "传统模式都是基于美元信用强的基础上：资源国和生产国赚美元-投美元-美元回流似乎有更多“资金”消费。但是2026年，世界央行黄金储备量已经超过美元储备量，成为第一大储备了。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "16369-16452", "abstract": "而共生模式的基础是美元的信用，只要美元的公信力存在，制造核心国和资源核心国就会将其大量外汇储备投到美国，压低美国长期利率，维持美国资产价格膨胀，使得国民消费快速增长。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 8, "chapterName": "03 “色即是空” 世界经济的共生模式与国际资源品价格调节新机制", "chapterIdx": 8, "reviewId": "306739280_89PrItFGI", "userVid": 306739280, "topics": [], "createTime": 1781337581, "userEditTime": 1781338059, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "03 “色即是空” 世界经济的共生模式与国际资源品价格调节新机制", "author": {"userVid": 306739280, "name": "Jiayi", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/jOiccFykLdhSbLwaDq9cVbArwDT4ae6WxIDZCcbh9kGb94hkuDJOCQ41KicvSfjfMddllYk5V87Iqj8LQhtslq2WBnIIQUdpAiajCicyaho7icv4/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "Jiayi", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-200", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 200}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 1, "likes": [{"userVid": 319055111, "name": "timmmm", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/xlMDrIh4LLRcVyXgtdDBlRY7IYgibyaoYCYyFgMhrY7CeMJEtXfMsLXiaZ0H5Ix92rF9vse0hxLJN26s4VTjoUCQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20250331-25", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "狂暴阅读周", "levelIndex": 25}}], "commentsCount": 3, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "所以是不是可以理解为，最后谁解决了能源问题，比如核聚变，谁就成为新一轮游戏的主导者。为啥现在人类为商业航天概念狂欢，实际上就是秀肌肉，因为商业航天底层技术也是离不开核聚变。", "reviewId": "306739280_89PrItFGI", "commentId": "306739280_89PrItFGI_c306739280_89Psr8yBt", "userVid": 306739280, "createTime": 1781338241, "author": {"userVid": 306739280, "name": "Jiayi", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/jOiccFykLdhSbLwaDq9cVbArwDT4ae6WxIDZCcbh9kGb94hkuDJOCQ41KicvSfjfMddllYk5V87Iqj8LQhtslq2WBnIIQUdpAiajCicyaho7icv4/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "Jiayi", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-200", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 200}}}, {"content": "会不会新一轮生产力由AI开启后，硬通货就是Token/算力，算力需要消耗大量的电，靠传统火电、绿电效率应该很难突破，那么要AI大规模应用于生产，首先还是要回到基础科学-核电（可控核聚变）。", "reviewId": "306739280_89PrItFGI", "commentId": "306739280_89PrItFGI_c306739280_89PscmPmX", "userVid": 306739280, "createTime": 1781338022, "author": {"userVid": 306739280, "name": "Jiayi", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/jOiccFykLdhSbLwaDq9cVbArwDT4ae6WxIDZCcbh9kGb94hkuDJOCQ41KicvSfjfMddllYk5V87Iqj8LQhtslq2WBnIIQUdpAiajCicyaho7icv4/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "Jiayi", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-200", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 200}}}, {"content": "去美元化已经成为趋势，后续这个游戏要怎么玩下去呢？什么东西才会成为这个游戏的硬通货呢", "reviewId": "306739280_89PrItFGI", "commentId": "306739280_89PrItFGI_c306739280_89PrMBKnw", "userVid": 306739280, "createTime": 1781337642, "author": {"userVid": 306739280, "name": "Jiayi", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/jOiccFykLdhSbLwaDq9cVbArwDT4ae6WxIDZCcbh9kGb94hkuDJOCQ41KicvSfjfMddllYk5V87Iqj8LQhtslq2WBnIIQUdpAiajCicyaho7icv4/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide"